      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 4  Uisce Dubh,  Ballintra,  F94 RXH5 \r\n\r\nExcellent 3 B/r Semi-Detached Residence\r\n\r\nCompleted to an exceptionally high standard\r\n\r\nSituate in a quiet residential estate of just 12 No. Houses -  10 of which are complete,  located just off the Donegal Town / Sligo N15 Roadway,  11 km south of Donegal Town,  Only 6 km from Rossnowlagh Beach and 5 km to Murvagh Golf Club.\r\n\r\nOriginally constructed in 2009 and recently completed to a very high standard, both internally & externally.   Extending to  84.83 sq.m.  (912 sq.ft.) and comprising -\r\n\r\nLiving Room,  Kitchen / Dining,  Utility,  W.C.;  3 No. Bedrooms & Bathroom.\r\n\r\nBallintra Village has 2 No. Primary Schools,  3 No. Churches,  Convenience Shop, Pub etc..\r\nA local link bus connects to both Donegal Town & Ballyshannon several times per day.\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway \t\t3.05 m. x 2.05 m.\ttiled floor\r\n\r\nW.C. \t\t\t\tToilet and Wash Basin; tiled floor and lower walls\r\n\r\nLiving Room \t\t3.76 m. x 3.43 m.   tiled floor; opening to -\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen \t\t\t3.87 m. x 3.60 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tfitted units with integrated fridge freezer and dishwasher,  \t\t\t\tbuilt-in oven and electric hob, extractor fan; tiled floor;  \t\t\t\t\tsliding doors to rear patio and garden\r\n  \r\n\r\nUtility \t\t\t1.96 m. x 1.34 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tfitted units; plumbed for washing machine; door to rear\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor.\r\nLanding\r\nBedroom No. 1 \t\t3.57 m. x 3.31 m.  laminated flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 2 \t\t3.80 m. x 2.82 m.  laminated flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 3 \t\t2.67 m. x 2.58 m.  laminated flooring, built-in storage closet \t\t\t\tover stairs\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom \t\t\t2.14 m. x 1.74 m. bath with electric shower overhead, toilet \t\t\t\tand wash basin; fully tiled\r\n\r\nOil fired central heating\t\tP.V.C.  Double Glazed Windows\r\nTo the rear is a private garden\tOff Street Parking for 2 Cars\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nAnderson Auctioneers for itself and as agent for the vendor gives notice that:\r\n\r\nThese particulars are only a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees and do not constitute in whole or in part, an offer or a Contract.\r\n\r\nAny intending purchaser or lessee should satisfy themselves by inspection, searches, inquiries, and survey as to the correctness of each statement.\r\n\r\n[OR] Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intending purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given.\r\n\r\nAll statements in these particulars are made on the without responsibility part of Anderson Auctioneers or the vendor \r\n\r\nNo statement in these particulars is to be relied upon as a statement or representation of fact.\r\n\r\nNeither Anderson Auctioneers nor anyone in its employment or acting on its behalf has authority to make any representation or warranty in relation to this property.\r\n\r\nNothing in these particulars shall be deemed to be a statement that the property is in good repair or condition or otherwise nor that any services or facilities are in good working order.\r\n\r\nPhotographs may show only certain parts and aspects of the property at the time when the photographs were taken and you should rely upon actual inspection.\r\n\r\nNo assumption should be made in respect of parts of the property not shown in photographs.\r\n\r\nAny areas, measurements, or distances are only approximate.\r\n\r\nAny reference to alterations or use is not intended to be a statement that any necessary planning, building regulation, listed building or any other consent has been obtained."
